message: "If you use this corpus or code in your research, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "CFMC-Research: A Corpus-Based Study on the Cognitive Mechanisms of Chinese Copular Metaphorical Constructions"
abstract: "This research builds upon Sullivan's (2013) theory of metaphorical constructions to develop the Cognitive Framework for Metaphorical Constructions (CFMC) for Chinese copular metaphors. The framework is validated through a corpus of 5,989 annotated constructions, testing a four-stage cognitive encoding mechanism."
